<title>UK: IFCT sets two bonds for total $500 mln.</title>
<headline>IFCT sets two bonds for total $500 mln.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Industrial Finance Corp of Thailand Plc has launched two bonds to total $500 million, lead manager Lehman Brothers said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>FIVE-YEAR BOND</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     7.125 PCT MATURITY    04.AUG.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.925    PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.925    SPREAD     +120 BP</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>10-YEAR BOND</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     7.0 PCT   MATURITY   *04.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.717    PAY DATE    04.AUG.97</p>
<p> REOFFER    99.717    SPREAD     +112.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*PAR PUT OPTION IN AUGUST 2002</p>
<p>* * * * *</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS</p>
<p> MOODY	A3	  LISTING    UNLISTED</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A-	  NOTES	CREDIT PROTECTION STEP-UP</p>
<p>CLAUSE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
